{
  "name": "Etsy Competitor Shop Monthly Revenue, Best-Selling Listings & Tag Spy",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Etsy Competitor Shop Monthly Revenue, Best-Selling Listings & Tag Spy\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nReverse-engineer top Etsy shops to see estimated monthly revenue, high-converting listing tags, and pricing tiers.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/etsy-shop-revenue-sales-keyword-analyzer`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/etsy-shop-revenue-sales-keyword-analyzer) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Etsy Shop Revenue, Sales & Keyword Analyzer** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "3f328fdf-f5aa-411f-a7ec-9df083b67742",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Etsy Shop Revenue, Sales & Keyword Analyzer** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "1e4d10c8-e880-4666-a2e5-37946005305b",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "9609fe3c-b75f-4ba0-ab6e-26ef5a853bd3",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
